12:["A food inspector needs to know whether a sweet contains a banned dye. How can a strip of paper reveal it?","fig:G_CHROMA",[["Health","Hospital labs test blood and urine with titrations, chromatography and ion tests."],["Food safety","The Zambia Bureau of Standards tests foods and drinks for purity."],["Environment","Testing water for metal ions helps detect pollution from mines."]],[3,7,12],["How do we measure accurately in experiments?","How are mixtures separated and purity checked?","How do we identify ions and gases?"]]
